%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: dash and line parameters. The dash array with its phase, the
% cap, the join, and the mitre limit are set before the stroke; the line
% width is left at its default and so is not set at all.
[3 1] 0 setdash
1 setlinecap
2 setlinejoin
4 setmiterlimit
10 10 moveto 100 10 lineto stroke
showpage
